OL,3,AMet Police says letter with claims
OL,4,Aabout Meghan's father not shared with
OL,5,Aother law enforcement
OL,6,
OL,7,FA letter making a "number of claims"
OL,8,Frelating to the Duchess of Sussex's
OL,9,Ffather was received by the Metropolitan
OL,10,FPolice in 2019, Scotland Yard has
OL,11,Fconfirmed.
OL,13,FThe Met said it passed the information
OL,14,Frelating to allegations outside the UK
OL,15,Fto the office of the Duke and Duchess
OL,16,Fbut did not share it with other law
OL,17,Fenforcement agencies.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
