OL,3,AStorm Boelo hits UK with wind and rain
OL,4,Aas warnings issued for large parts of
OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,8,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,9,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,10,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,12,FSome Scottish rail lines will close
OL,13,Ffrom 21:00, with winds of up to 70mph
OL,14,Fforecast
OL,16,FMeanwhile, a marathon in the Eryri
OL,17,Fnational park in north Wales has been
OL,18,Fcancelled, as well as a range of events
OL,19,Fin England, Scotland, and Northern
OL,20,FIreland
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
