OL,3,AUkraine says Starlink connection 'now
OL,4,Astable' after network limits
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine now has a "stable connection"
OL,7,Fto Starlink, its defence minister has
OL,8,Fsaid, after its military suffered days
OL,9,Fof restricted connectivity on the
OL,10,Fsatellite internet network.
OL,12,FKyiv relies on the Starlink and its
OL,13,Fmilitary-grade counterpart Starshield
OL,14,Ffor piloting drones and operations
OL,15,Fwithin Ukraine, but last week accused
OL,16,FUS President Donald Trump of telling
OL,17,Fowner Elon Musk to place limits on it.
OL,19,FThis meant drones would lose connection
OL,20,Fwhen travelling at 161km/h (100mph) or
OL,21,Fmore, it said. Trump denied doing so
OL,22,Fbefore saying Musk had "put it back".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
